      "statement": "gpi_tracker_events is a TDIP payments-domain dataset (Snowflake) that copies the Oracle table GPI_TRACKER_SNAPSHOT; it is classified Confidential - Client, retains history since 2025-03-01, is loaded nightly at 05:00 ET, and is moving to hourly refresh per in-progress Jira story TDA-2188 (target 2026-11), with data ownership Laura Kim / Carlos Mendes.",
