    {
      "id": "claim_21f0d5ca6d4e4e6aaed0ed7cf45a5a20",
      "statement": "Because gpi_tracker_events is Confidential - Client under DUS-07, derived feature tables inherit the most-restrictive permitted purpose of their inputs, cross-client cohort statistics shown to clients must meet DUS-07 thresholds (>=500 transactions, >=20 distinct clients, no client >15% of volume, monthly refresh, DRC-approved wording) or be suppressed, and client's-own-data insights need at least 5 comparable transactions with stated basis; any forward-looking customer-facing estimate built on it is Tier 2 (or higher) under MRM-POL-02 requiring independent validation before client display.",
